{"version":1,"content":"<p>玩家在《GTA 6》中發現了一個極為複雜的隱藏彩蛋，完成特定解謎後，遊戲會打開一個「傳送門」，將玩家帶回2002年原版《俠盜獵車手：罪惡都市》中的馬裏布俱樂部。這一發現由澳大利亞YouTube博主Memeio公佈，他同時發佈了完整的解謎攻略。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587754.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.199916+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:44:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"6f219edd56a05b842730197a3a1f5afe75a63c4184b1ee87cfbeca651cfe2a62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}